{"seq":1,"slug":"event-catalog-design","title":"事件目录与 Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/event-catalog-design","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件目录与-schema-设计\">事件目录与 Schema 设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件目录是 webhook 系统的 API 契约层——它定义了消费者能订阅的事件类型、每种事件的 payload 结构、以及发现与治理机制。本文覆盖事件命名体系、JSON Schema 定义、CloudEvents 规范集成、订阅粒度设计、thin/fat payload 策略、以及目录生命周期治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件类型命名体系\">事件类型命名体系</h2><p>事件目录（Event Catalog）是 webhook 系统的 API 契约——它定义了消费者能订阅什么、期望收到什么。一个设计良好的命名体系让消费者能按需精确订阅，避免收到无关事件。</p>\n<p>行业主流采用<strong>资源.动作</strong>（resource.action）的点号分隔命名：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>命名模式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Stripe</td>\n<td><code>resource.action</code></td>\n<td><code>invoice.paid</code>, <code>customer.subscription.deleted</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td><code>resource.action</code></td>\n<td><code>pull_request.opened</code>, <code>issues.labeled</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td><code>resource/action</code></td>\n<td><code>orders/create</code>, <code>products/update</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudEvents</td>\n<td>反向域名 + 资源 + 动作</td>\n<td><code>com.company.orders.created</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐的命名规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{namespace}.{resource}.{sub_resource}.{action}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{namespace}.{resource}.{sub_resource}.{action}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>namespace</strong> — 可选，多产品线时区分来源（如 <code>billing.invoice.paid</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>resource</strong> — 核心业务实体，使用单数形式</li>\n<li><strong>sub_resource</strong> — 嵌套实体（如 <code>customer.subscription</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>action</strong> — 过去时态动词描述已发生的状态变化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>动作词汇应保持一致性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应 CRUD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>created</code></td>\n<td>资源新建</td>\n<td>Create</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updated</code></td>\n<td>任意字段变更</td>\n<td>Update</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deleted</code></td>\n<td>资源移除</td>\n<td>Delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>completed</code></td>\n<td>异步流程结束</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>failed</code></td>\n<td>异步流程失败</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事件-schema-设计\">事件 Schema 设计</h2><p>每个事件类型需要一份正式的 Schema 定义。JSON Schema 是 webhook 领域的事实标准：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;  &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;id&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;事件唯一标识符&quot;,&#10;      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^evt_[a-zA-Z0-9]{10,}$&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;      &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;invoice.paid&quot;],&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;事件类型&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;api_version&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{2}$&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;created_at&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;      &quot;format&quot;: &quot;date-time&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;$ref&quot;: &quot;#/$defs/InvoicePaidData&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;, &quot;created_at&quot;, &quot;data&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"事件唯一标识符\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^evt_[a-zA-Z0-9]{10,}$\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"invoice.paid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"事件类型\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"api_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d{4}-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d{2}-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d{2}$\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"date-time\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"$ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#/$defs/InvoicePaidData\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Schema 是版本管理的基石——有了形式化的字段定义，才能自动化检测 breaking change（参见 <a href=\"../operations/versioning-deprecation\">版本管理与废弃策略</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cloudevents-规范集成\">CloudEvents 规范集成</h2><p>CloudEvents（CNCF 孵化项目，v1.0.2 稳定版）定义了厂商中立的事件元数据标准。2026 年越来越多的平台（Indeed、Azure Web PubSub、Fly.io）原生采用 CloudEvents 格式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CloudEvents 核心属性] --&gt; B[specversion: 1.0]&#10;    A --&gt; C[id: 唯一标识]&#10;    A --&gt; D[source: 事件来源 URI]&#10;    A --&gt; E[type: 事件类型]&#10;    A --&gt; F[time: 发生时间]&#10;    A --&gt; G[datacontenttype: 载荷格式]&#10;    A --&gt; H[data: 业务载荷]&#10;    A --&gt; I[扩展属性: 自定义元数据]\">graph TD\n    A[CloudEvents 核心属性] --&gt; B[specversion: 1.0]\n    A --&gt; C[id: 唯一标识]\n    A --&gt; D[source: 事件来源 URI]\n    A --&gt; E[type: 事件类型]\n    A --&gt; F[time: 发生时间]\n    A --&gt; G[datacontenttype: 载荷格式]\n    A --&gt; H[data: 业务载荷]\n    A --&gt; I[扩展属性: 自定义元数据]</pre><p>CloudEvents 通过 HTTP Protocol Binding 支持两种传输模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>Content-Type</th>\n<th>属性位置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Structured</td>\n<td><code>application/cloudevents+json</code></td>\n<td>JSON body 内</td>\n<td>通用、易调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Binary</td>\n<td>原始 <code>datacontenttype</code></td>\n<td><code>ce-</code> 前缀 HTTP 头</td>\n<td>已有 payload 格式不想改变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Structured 模式</strong>将所有属性和数据封装在一个 JSON 对象中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;specversion&quot;: &quot;1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;evt_2kx9mR7vLq&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;/services/billing&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;com.acme.invoice.paid&quot;,&#10;  &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T10:30:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;datacontenttype&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: { &quot;invoice_id&quot;: &quot;inv_8n3x&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 4999 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"specversion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"evt_2kx9mR7vLq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/services/billing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.acme.invoice.paid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T10:30:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"datacontenttype\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"invoice_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inv_8n3x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4999</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Binary 模式</strong>将元数据放在 HTTP 头，body 只包含业务数据——适合大体积 payload 或需要中间件透明转发的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"standard-webhooks-与-cloudevents-的选择\">Standard Webhooks 与 CloudEvents 的选择</h2><p>两个规范解决不同层面的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Standard Webhooks</th>\n<th>CloudEvents</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关注点</td>\n<td>签名安全 + 投递可靠性</td>\n<td>事件格式标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>三个 HTTP 头</td>\n<td>完整事件信封</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制程度</td>\n<td>签名算法固定</td>\n<td>格式灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>Svix、Clerk、Resend</td>\n<td>Azure、GCP、Knative</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者<strong>不互斥</strong>——可以在 CloudEvents 格式的事件上叠加 Standard Webhooks 的签名头。这正是 Azure Web PubSub 的做法：事件格式遵循 CloudEvents，安全层使用 HMAC 签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件目录的组织与发现\">事件目录的组织与发现</h2><p>消费者需要一种机制发现可订阅的事件类型。成熟的实现提供：</p>\n<p><strong>事件目录 API</strong>——以 Svix 为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /api/v1/event-type&#10;Response:&#10;{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;invoice.paid&quot;,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;发票已支付&quot;,&#10;      &quot;schemas&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;1&quot;: { &quot;$ref&quot;: &quot;...&quot; }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;feature_flag&quot;: null,&#10;      &quot;deprecated&quot;: false&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /api/v1/event-type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Response:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"data\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"name\": \"invoice.paid\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"description\": \"发票已支付\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"schemas\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"1\": { \"$ref\": \"...\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"feature_flag\": null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"deprecated\": false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>AsyncAPI 文档</strong>——机器可读的事件契约定义，支持代码生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"asyncapi: &#39;2.6.0&#39;&#10;channels:&#10;  /webhooks/invoice:&#10;    publish:&#10;      message:&#10;        $ref: &#39;#/components/messages/InvoicePaid&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">asyncapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.6.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /webhooks/invoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/messages/InvoicePaid'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"事件分组与订阅粒度\">事件分组与订阅粒度</h2><p>事件目录的粒度设计直接影响消费者体验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>太粗</strong>（如只有 <code>invoice.*</code>）— 消费者收到大量无关事件，增加处理负担</li>\n<li><strong>太细</strong>（如每个字段变更一个事件）— 事件类型爆炸，目录难以维护</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐采用<strong>分层订阅</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>订阅粒度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>通配符</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">invoice.*</mtext><mtext>（接收所有发票事件）</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>精确</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">invoice.paid</mtext><mtext>（只接收已支付）</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>过滤</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">invoice.paid</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">WHERE</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">amount</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">&gt;</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">1000</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{订阅粒度} = \\begin{cases}\n\\text{通配符} &amp; \\texttt{invoice.*} \\text{（接收所有发票事件）} \\\\\n\\text{精确} &amp; \\texttt{invoice.paid} \\text{（只接收已支付）} \\\\\n\\text{过滤} &amp; \\texttt{invoice.paid WHERE amount &gt; 1000}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订阅粒度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通配符</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">精确</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">过滤</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">invoice.*</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（接收所有发票事件）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">invoice.paid</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（只接收已支付）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">invoice.paid WHERE amount &gt; 1000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>通配符订阅简化了入门体验，精确订阅减少噪声，条件过滤则是 Svix 和 Hookdeck 在 2026 年新增的高级功能——让消费者用表达式过滤事件，进一步减少不必要的投递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"thin-vs-fat-payload-的-schema-策略\">Thin vs Fat Payload 的 Schema 策略</h2><p><a href=\"../fundamentals/webhook-architecture-patterns\">Webhook 架构与模式</a> 讨论了 thin/fat payload 的选择。无论哪种，Schema 都应明确文档化：</p>\n<p><strong>Fat payload schema</strong>直接定义完整资源结构。挑战是资源模型变更时 schema 频繁更新。</p>\n<p><strong>Thin payload schema</strong>只定义引用信息加 fetch URL。优势是 schema 稳定性高（资源结构变更不影响 webhook 格式），代价是消费者必须依赖 API 获取完整数据。</p>\n<p>实践中的折中方案是<strong>变更摘要</strong>（change summary）：payload 包含变更的字段名和新值，但不包含整个资源快照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;customer.updated&quot;,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;cus_9x3k&quot;,&#10;    &quot;changes&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;email&quot;: { &quot;previous&quot;: &quot;old@example.com&quot;, &quot;current&quot;: &quot;new@example.com&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;api_url&quot;: &quot;/v1/customers/cus_9x3k&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customer.updated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cus_9x3k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"changes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"previous\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"old@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"current\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"api_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/v1/customers/cus_9x3k\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式让消费者能快速判断是否需要采取行动，而无需回调 API 获取完整资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件目录治理\">事件目录治理</h2><p>随着产品演进，事件目录需要严格的治理流程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新增事件类型</strong>需要 Schema review，确认命名一致性</li>\n<li><strong>字段变更</strong>触发兼容性检查（新增字段为 optional，不能删除/重命名已有字段）</li>\n<li><strong>废弃事件类型</strong>应在目录中标记 <code>deprecated: true</code> 并设置 sunset 日期</li>\n<li><strong>Schema 注册表</strong>存储所有版本的 schema，支持消费者按版本获取</li>\n</ul>\n<p>事件目录的扇出实现细节——如何将匹配的事件高效分发到订阅者——见 <a href=\"fanout-delivery-engine\">扇出投递引擎</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>事件目录是 provider 与消费者之间的核心契约。命名采用 <code>resource.action</code> 模式保持一致性，JSON Schema 提供形式化的字段定义支撑版本管理。CloudEvents 和 Standard Webhooks 解决不同层面的问题且可叠加使用。订阅粒度从通配符到条件过滤分层提供，平衡入门体验与噪声控制。Schema 治理——新增 review、兼容性检查、废弃标记——是目录长期健康的保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件目录与 Schema 设计","id":"事件目录与-schema-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件类型命名体系","id":"事件类型命名体系"},{"level":2,"text":"事件 Schema 设计","id":"事件-schema-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"CloudEvents 规范集成","id":"cloudevents-规范集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Standard Webhooks 与 CloudEvents 的选择","id":"standard-webhooks-与-cloudevents-的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"事件目录的组织与发现","id":"事件目录的组织与发现"},{"level":2,"text":"事件分组与订阅粒度","id":"事件分组与订阅粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"Thin vs Fat Payload 的 Schema 策略","id":"thin-vs-fat-payload-的-schema-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"事件目录治理","id":"事件目录治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Webhook 安全与签名验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-security-verification"},"next":{"title":"扇出投递引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/fanout-delivery-engine"}}